        <mxCell id="key" value="&lt;b&gt;Notation&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 = exactly one&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; 0..1 = zero or one&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; M = many&lt;br&gt;PK = primary key (document ID)&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; FK = foreign key (ID of another document)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Firestore is a document database, so an FK field stores another document's ID. Request Item is stored inside Seedling Request (items[]). References to the person who acted (encodedBy, actorId, createdBy, authenticatedSubmitterUid) and the siteId fields of capture sessions, cohorts and visits are listed as FK fields but not drawn as lines.&amp;nbsp;Technical collections (hashes, quotas, counters, audit logs, upload intents) are left out." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=10;fontSize=11;strokeColor=#000000;fillColor=#ffffff;fontFamily=Helvetica;fontColor=#000000;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="720" y="1340" width="920" height="120" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
